        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Rain 1: Attunement for 2 blades is great, but having Quietus means you can't abuse Attunement\nRain 2: Able to be Attunement Abused, but 2 cost is very very bad, I'd take Rain 0 over this\nRain 3: This is actually a pretty funny build around\nRain 4: Spending AP to create Blades feels bad, and retrieve is not very important\nRain 5: Extremely Niche, basically just turns Effulgent Release into an AOE, but it has Retain Exhaust\nRain 0 is actually good, since it doesn't have Quietus and Thus can be Abused for Attunement Blades"
          }
        },
