        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Hero 1: Gives it link so its even easier to make it a 0 cost draw 3, great\nHero 2: On average very very bad, since you run your hand dry and have to start using 2+ cost draw\nHero 3: Just a cantrip that makes you able to discard all of Diana's cards\nHero 4: 0 Cost Exhaust 2 Tutor, THAT ALSO Applies Link for Quietus Upgrades, Insanely good\nHero 5: Makes you -1 Cycle for Sword Rain Attunement at the cost of -1 AP"
